@title Wiring guide: click the Shape switch to change between Corners and Lines
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# The strip at the bottom of the drawing ends in a framed switch that names the current wire shape and the other one;
# clicking it switches without starting or ending a wire (nothing is drawn).
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key w
wait 3
move 800 450
wait 3
shot shape-corners
expect_scene "wire"
click 1002 720
wait 5
move 800 450
wait 3
shot shape-lines
click 1002 720
wait 5
move 800 450
wait 3
shot shape-corners-again
